==Battleground==
*6 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hikakin (Enemy)|Hikakin]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

